WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.910
Everything one does in life should be for
the interest of fun.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:13.290
Not fun merely in the sense of play or leisure,
but fun in the sense of deriving excitement

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.869
and enjoyment from life in general.

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:23.449
We must alter our perspective of life in such
a way that prompts a movie-like observational

00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:25.460
experience of it.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:32.149
A second person perspective that enables us
to find entertainment and intrigue in both

00:00:32.149 --> 00:00:36.030
the hardships and the joys of life.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:42.020
It is easy to slip into the feeling that life
is pointless when you neglect the objective

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.920
of fun.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:50.920
When you ignore fun, you become hung up on
destructive mindsets and routines.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:57.110
You work and worry and adopt the delusion
that fun will come at the end of life.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:58.650
But it won’t.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:04.210
Your journey will end sooner than later, and
when it does, you can’t take anything with

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.210
you.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:10.160
And all the fun you’ve been waiting to have
won’t carry over.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:16.510
We can’t store life away in the closet,
hoping it will accrue in value.

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:21.440
Life is not like a vintage sports memorabilia
hat or jersey.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:26.790
You cannot wait fifty years without touching
it and then sell it for profit.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:33.340
It only has any value when you wear and enjoy
it right now.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:39.530
Life crumbles of all meaning when we become
stuck to this idea that someone will buy our

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:46.690
life at the end of it, just because it is
in mint, untouched condition.

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:54.300
There will be no buyer and we will have forgotten
how to simply have fun and laugh at the obscurity

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.440
of it all.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:59.479
Imagine life as just one day.

00:01:59.479 --> 00:02:06.420
Just like an actual day, if you wake up too
late, or not all, you miss out on experiencing

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:07.729
it.

00:02:07.729 --> 00:02:11.620
And you want to be awake for it as much as
you can.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:17.650
Wake up and understand that life is not something
to hide under the covers from.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:23.250
Realize that life can be serious but does
not have to be arduous.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:28.840
Take care of the tasks required to function
in the modern world but know that they are

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:34.150
temporary and not to be solely identified
with.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:41.170
WHAT you do in life is far less relevant than
HOW you do the “what” in life.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:47.541
There are innumerable belief systems and ways
of living out the “what” in life, but

00:02:47.541 --> 00:02:53.790
they are all bound by the same desired life-force
of fun and enjoyment.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:03:00.770
You can either give life a point by seeing
it as an incredible opportunity to experience

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:08.560
the reality of the world as your unique consciousness,
embracing your profound ability to play with

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:12.390
life like a malleable clay-like substance.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:18.599
Or you can live with your arms crossed and
pout in the corner.

00:03:18.599 --> 00:03:19.189
Your choice.

